<title>JAPAN: Kyowa Hakko - 96/97 group results.</title>
<headline>Kyowa Hakko - 96/97 group results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-06-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to March 31, 1997</p>
<p> (Group)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p>			12-MONTH			   3-MONTH</p>
<p>			TO MAR 97			  TO MAR 96</p>
<p> Sales		397.63		vs	   82.99</p>
<p> Operating	   29.84		vs	    5.77</p>
<p> Current	     26.02		vs	    4.78</p>
<p> Net		   12.34		vs	     1.3</p>
<p> EPS		   27.64 yen	  vs	    2.90 yen</p>
<p> Diluted EPS	 27.02 yen	  vs	    2.83 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Kyowa Hakko Kogyo Co Ltd is a major amino acid maker. The company had no comparison for previous year as it had an irregular three-month period to change its business year to end March from the previous December.</p>
</text>
